<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Telesp still a hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Telesp still a hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- ING Barings said it was maintaining a hold rating on Brazil's Telesp, a unit of state-owned telecommunications firm Telebras serving Sao Paulo state.</p>
<p>-- It also suggested a swap from Telesp into Telebras shares as Telesp is currently undervalued.</p>
<p>-- &quot;At current prices, we prefer Telebras, which we believe has the potential to appreciate by 46 percent,&quot; it said in a report.</p>
<p>-- Telesp preferred fell 0.34 percent to 290 reais earlier on the Sao Paulo bolsa.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
</text>
